  "correction": "The verifier incorrectly required null prior_active_operation_id on status/result reads. Original exact requests correctly bind these to their own already-admitted observer. Require original operation_id for operation_status/operation_result; keep null for each new admission/write. No original request/source or Runtime behavior changes.",
